   "widgets_values": [
    "Pixel art character design of a young pokemon trainer: a girl with a red cap, short brown hair, a white jacket over a black shirt, blue shorts and a yellow messenger bag. Full body from head to feet, standing straight, facing the viewer, front view, arms relaxed, about three heads tall. Style of the Pokemon HeartGold and SoulSilver sprites: clean dark 1-pixel outline, flat cel shading with two or three tones per color, limited palette, crisp square pixels, no anti-aliasing, no blur, no gradient. Single character, centered, plain solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no shadow on the ground, no text, no frame."
